@tool
extends EditorPlugin
## Top-Down Controller editor plugin.
##
## Library addon: ships the player scenes (3D model and 2.5D sprite variants), the
## movement/combat states, the camera rig and the sprite helpers for direct use, so
## there is nothing to auto-register. The plugin entry exists only so the addon can
## be enabled/disabled and published to the Asset Library.
##
## Depends on the Components Kit (enable it too).
